@startuml
title AQUA-DRIFT Component Diagram (Docker containers)
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

node "Docker Compose network: aqua-drift" {
  component "clock\n(1 s synchronized tick)" as Clock
  component "target\n(constant HDG/STW/depth,\nrate-limited changes)" as Target
  component "observer × 1..100\n(one container each,\npassive drift)" as Observer
  component "current-field\n(affine truth field)" as Field
  component "doppler\n(acoustic source / Doppler + bearing)" as Doppler
  component "estimator\n(PF + resample-move + CPA)" as Estimator
  component "deployer\n(forward / 前程 deployment\nfrom the estimate)" as Deployer
  component "layer\n(設標者: flies to approved\ndrop points, lays observers)" as Layer
  component "api\n(FastAPI, WebSocket,\nsingle DB writer)" as API
  database "db\nPostgreSQL + PostGIS\n(immutable event history)" as DB
  component "web\n(nginx + CesiumJS,\nNatural Earth II offline)" as GIS
}

Clock --> API : POST /internal/clock
Target --> Field : GET /vector
Observer --> Field : GET /vector
Target --> API : POST /internal/target (truth)
Observer --> API : GET assignment / POST state
Doppler --> API : GET /internal/sim-state\nPOST /internal/doppler (obs + truth)
Estimator --> API : GET /internal/estimator-feed\n(observations only)\nPOST /internal/estimate
API --> DB
Deployer --> API : GET /internal/deployment-feed\n(estimates only)\nPOST /internal/deploy
Layer --> API : GET /internal/layer-feed\nPOST /internal/layer
GIS --> API : /api/* , /ws

note bottom of Estimator
Inputs: time, exact observer position/depth,
Doppler frequency, detected flag,
recognized source frequency, bearing (σ15°, 15 s).
No range, no truth. Start/stop by operator.
end note
@enduml
